 ## Changes since v7.15.0
 
+- fix: don't try to obtain the source IP for trusted IP checks when no trusted IPs are configured or the request arrives over a unix socket without reverse proxy mode
+
 # V7.15.0
 
 - [#3382](https://github.com/oauth2-proxy/oauth2-proxy/pull/3382) chore(deps): update gomod and golangci/golangci-lint to v2.11.4 (@tuunit)
